      en: ["Founded in 1933, making it one of the oldest in the region.", "Located in the prime Gombe district of Kinshasa.", "Historically housed over 1,000 animals across various species.", "Underwent several phases of neglect and restoration efforts.", "Serves as a rescue point for animals seized from illegal trade.", "A key site for urban environmental education programs."],
