      en: ["Tshela is a territory in Kongo Central province, near the border with Angola.", "Cocoa cultivation was introduced in the early 1900s by Portuguese and Belgian interests.", "The predominant cocoa variety is Forastero, known for its robustness.", "Cooperatives like 'Cacao Okapi' work to improve quality and prices.", "The cocoa is exported via the port of Matadi.", "The region produces several thousand metric tons of cocoa beans annually."],
