      en: ["The Uele River is one of the two headstreams of the Ubangi River.", "The region is characterized by a savanna climate with distinct wet and dry seasons.", "Cassava is the primary staple crop grown in the region.", "Robusta coffee cultivation was formerly a major industry in Haut-Uele.", "The river serves as a vital transportation route for local communities.", "Agriculture in the region is predominantly rain-fed."],
