      en: ["Kwilu is a province in western DR Congo, created from the Kwilu district in 2015.", "The Huileries du Congo Belge (HCB) was founded in 1911 by William Lever.", "The oil palm tree is native to West and Southwest Africa.", "The traditional processing method is labor-intensive and yields lower returns.", "Kikwit, the provincial capital, is a major commercial hub for palm oil.", "A single tree can produce fruit for over 30 years."],
